      "label": "0",
      "explanation": "The senator is expressing pleasure regarding a decision made by an independent board (TVA). Though he mentions it has been a priority, he does not claim personal responsibility or influence in securing the action. This is classified as position-taking."
    },
    {
      "document_id": "2382",
      "label": "1",
